-- damhuis-restaurant-melkbosstrand (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Damhuis Restaurant, known as Die Damhuis, serves seafood and traditional South African cuisine from one of the oldest buildings in the Western Cape, a declared national monument on the Melkbosstrand beachfront. The dining room''s heritage setting comes with views across to Table Mountain and Robben Island, and the kitchen focuses on fresh seafood alongside hearty, traditional South African dishes.

